{"PASSING_PLAYER","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral",{"Hands like leather and nothing to show for it","Hey","What's going on over there?","Hell of a week, huh?","How you holding up?","Hey, you. Know anybody who can fix a generator?","Twenty-two years at the plant and the world ends on my day off","Haven't been paid since the second, not that it matters now","Foreman's gone, so I'm the foreman, congratulations to me","You got a wrench? Never mind, I got one, habit","Union never covered this, I can tell you that","Could really use a beer, an ice-cold one, just saying","Ain't punched a clock in six days and I miss it, what's wrong with me","My boss said stay at your station, I'm leaving my station","Anybody over there still got a job? I'll trade you mine","I drove a bread truck for fifteen years, never once got bit by a customer","You see the plant on your way over? Anybody at the gate?","They'll come get us when it's over, that's what I keep telling the crew","Hey. You been to the lumberyard? Heard they've got nails","My hands are cut to hell and I still haven't found my gloves","Got a buddy at the sawmill, you seen him? Short, red beard, loud","Should've called in sick Friday, damn it","You look like somebody with a plan, I'm too tired to have one","Boots are worn through, I'd trade you my watch for a pair of boots","Spent twenty bucks on a lottery ticket Thursday, I'd like a refund","My truck's got a flat and the jack's missing, it's been that kind of week","Back's out, knees are out, hell, I'm out","Nobody pays attention to somebody in coveralls, so I'm doing fine","You don't have any duct tape, do you? Never mind, I just like asking","Got the whole shift out of the plant, lost two, I count that as a win","Somebody's out there, {he}'s by {himself}","Wave at {him}, no, don't, never mind","Anybody know {him}? Looks like {he} knows where {he}'s going","That one looks alright, keep an eye anyway","Who's that? Is that somebody's kid?","Not one of ours, but {he} walks like a person, so that's something","{He}'s heading straight into {town}, God help {him}","Don't stare, let {him} pass, we don't need a fight today","Know how to fix a radiator? I've got cigarettes to trade","Whoever stole my toolbox, I forgive you, I'm too tired to care","I used to run the forklift, now I run from them, hi","You see the old mill from there? There's a loading dock, don't use it","Pay phone's still ringing at the gas station, if you want to talk to nobody","If you see a green John Deere, it's mine, tell it I miss it","Foreman always said hard work pays off, I'd like a word with him","Hey, we're short a hand, if you're feeling friendly, no pay, just beans","Hey, you wouldn't believe what I found in a lunch box, don't ask","Sawmill's quiet now, no more whine, I miss the whine","Shit, you scared me, I thought you were one of them","Goddamn plant's got more dead than living, and I used to love that place","Piss on the whole damn county, I'm moving to Tennessee","Don't ask me to make sense of this shit","Damn hammer's heavier than it was on Friday, I'd bet it gains weight"}},
